          "segmentId": "m00068:alt:fig-00005-alt",
          "text": "The structures of cis- and trans-2-butene with delta H naught hydrogenation equals minus 120 and minus 116 kilojoules per mole, respectively."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_07_06_005.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
